  {
    "id": 1010003050040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こんばんは～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『こんばんはーっ！』\r\n『チョコちゃんこんばんは♪　配信見れてうれしい！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……あっ、見てくれてる方ちゃんといますね、\r\n嬉しいなぁ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……！　みんなもお忙しいところ、\r\nお時間頂いちゃってすみません……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『智代子のためなら余裕』",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ちょこっとだけ、私からのメッセージにお付き合いください",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『ちょこっと！』\r\n『ちょこっとと言わずたっぷりで！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『チョコの見ない顔ですねぇが見たい！』\r\n『チョコッと可愛いな～』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "コメントもちゃんと読んでますよ──って、えぇ！？\r\nそれはドラマのカホの台詞なんだけどな～っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でも、んんっ……！\r\n──『見ない顔ですねぇ……！』",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『やってくれた！』\r\n『可愛い～～～～♡』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ああっ……！　コメントは読んでいますが、無茶ぶりは！\r\n無茶ぶりは応えられなくても許してくださいね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──あっ、これはフリとかではなく！！",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『フリじゃんwww』\r\n『そういうこと言うからみんなやりたくなっちゃうんだよ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "うう……！　ごもっとも……！\r\n反省します……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『チョコちゃん泣かないでー！』\r\n『負けるな～』",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──はいっ、ありがとうございます……！\r\nえっと、では！　本題行きますよ、本題！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』の話です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『正座ー』\r\n『聞いて聞いてー』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は今、『G.R.A.D.』に参加しています\r\n現時点で予選を終えまして──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もうすぐ、大事な選考が控えています",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "なのでここで改めて、みんなに感謝と意気込みと、\r\nあとは公約？　なんかをお伝えできたらな、と……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『めちゃめちゃ律儀！』\r\n『チョコちゃん、窓の外に人影が……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こうやって直接やりとりができる機会も少なかった\r\nですから──ってオバケネタは禁止です！　ダメ！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『怖がってる笑』\r\n『大丈夫だよチョコ～～！』",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい、ありがとうございます……！\r\n気を取り直して……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──私は、今回のオーディションを通して、改めて……\r\n私を理解して、応援してくれる人の大きさを知りました",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こうやって、今配信を見てくれているみんなもそうです",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それから、リアルタイムが難しくても\r\n後で確認してくれるみんなも",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050230,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……私が伝えようとすることを、\r\n聞こうとしてくれる、わかろうとしてくれる",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050240,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それってとってもあったかいことで、心強いことで──\r\n私は、何度励まされたかわかりません",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050250,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "なので、本当に\r\nいつも応援してくれて、ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『こちらこそだよ！』\r\n『いつも頑張ってくれてありがとう～』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050260,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ふふ。こちらこそは、私の台詞なんですよ\r\nありがたいなぁ、助かるなぁって思いが尽きません",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050270,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──だから、私を応援してくれるみんなに\r\n私を支えて、何度だって立ち上がらせてくれるみんなに",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050280,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私はアイドルとして約束をします\r\nこれが公約です",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050290,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私を推したことを、後悔させません\r\nいつだって必ず、あなたを笑顔にできるようにします",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050300,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そして、もっともっとたくさんの人に\r\nこの約束ができるよう、引き続き努力します",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050310,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……これは意気込みにもかかっちゃいますかね\r\nでも、そういう気持ちで……うん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050320,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私は、そういう気持ちで、\r\nこれからもチョコアイドルとして走っていきます",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050330,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "まずは、『G.R.A.D.』を！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010003050340,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ですので、どうぞ、引き続き応援していただけましたら！\r\nよろしくお願いしますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000305/1010003050340"
  },
